units real
atom_style full

dimension 3
boundary p p p

bond_style hybrid harmonic
angle_style hybrid harmonic
dihedral_style hybrid charmm multi/harmonic
special_bonds lj 0.0 0.0 0.5 coul 0.0 0.0 0.833333

read_data mobley_2197088_converted.lmp

pair_style lj/cut/coul/cut 30.0 30.0
pair_modify tail no

pair_coeff 1 1   0.1094001   3.3996700
pair_coeff 2 2   0.0157000   2.6495300

pair_modify mix arithmetic

thermo_style custom ebond eangle edihed eimp epair evdwl ecoul elong etail pe

run 0
